Problem:
Emergency supplies need to be delivered to a remote area and can either go by airplane or helicopter. An airplane can transport 35 units of goods and takes 30 minutes while a helicopter can transport 20 units of goods and takes 10 minutes due to easier take-off and landing. The number of helicopters must exceed the number of airplanes. Additionally, there must be at least 5 airplanes to fully utilize the landing space.  If there needs to be at least 500 units of goods transported, how many of each type of transportation should be utilized to minimize the total number of minutes needed?

